{
  "abstract": "a(n) = (1/n) Σ_{k<n} (21k+8) C(2k,k)^3 is an integer divisible by 4 C(2n,n). Zhi-Wei Sun conjectured this in February 2010. Kasper Andersen confirmed it in a reply on the NMBRTHRY list by identifying a(n)/(4 C(2n,n)) with A112029(n−1). Sun records Andersen's identity in his paper Super congruences and Euler numbers (Sci. China Math. 2011).",
